ichelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/skill-advisor-cli-manifest.ts:\n  Line 125:     name: 'skill_graph_scan',\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tools/README.md:\n  Line 24: - `skill_graph_scan`, `skill_graph_query`, `skill_graph_status` and `skill_graph_validate` expose the advisor-owned skill graph command surface, and `skill_graph_propagate_enhances` reports or proposes missing inbound `enhances` edges without trusted-caller authority; only real apply mode (`mode: \"apply\"` with `dryRun` not true) requires a trusted caller.\n\n  Line 55: | `skill-graph-tools.ts` | Defines `skill_graph_scan`, `skill_graph_query`, `skill_graph_status`, `skill_graph_validate` and `skill_graph_propagate_enhances`. |\n\n  Line 93: | `skillGraphScanTool` | Descriptor | Registers `skill_graph_scan`. |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/skill-graph/scan.ts:\n  Line 4: // Command handler for skill_graph_scan — indexes skill metadata.\n\n  Line 29: /** Handle skill_graph_scan tool call */\n\n  Line 59:       reason: 'skill_graph_scan',\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/auto-indexing/doc-frontmatter-harvest.md:\n  Line 45: node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/changelog/v1.0.0.0.md:\n  Line 174: - **If you want meaning matching:** run Ollama with `nomic-embed-text`, then run `skill_graph_scan` so the command vectors are built.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/README.md:\n  Line 36: |   +-- scan.ts                # skill_graph_scan handler\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/references/runtime/tool-ids-reference.md:\n  Line 59: | `skill_graph_scan` | Index or re-index all `.skilled/skills/*/graph-metadata.json` files into `skill-graph.sqlite` using the hash-aware SQLite indexer. | optional `skillsRoot` (default `.skilled/skills`) | `scanResult`, `embeddings`, `sourceSignature` |\n\n  Line 85: Calls are sent untrusted by default, and the mutation commands (`advisor_rebuild`, `skill_graph_scan`, apply-mode `skill_graph_propagate_enhances`) additionally require `--trusted` or `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_CLI_TRUSTED=1`.\n\n  Line 110: | `skill_graph_scan` | `ScanArgs` (inline interface) | `HandlerResponse` envelope |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/manual-testing-playbook/auto-update-daemon/rebuild-from-source.md:\n  Line 65: node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --format json\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/references/runtime/freshness-contract.md:\n  Line 42: - It is **author-time, not runtime**: `advisor_rebuild`/`skill_graph_scan` re-index the existing derived block without re-stamping `generated_at`.\n\n  Line 146: - Rebuilding the index automatically. SQLite database writes happen through trusted maintenance paths such as `advisor_rebuild` and `skill_graph_scan`; corrupt-database recovery may also move aside and recreate the database during lazy initialization.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-rebuild.ts:\n  Line 116:  * just like skill_graph_scan; untrusted callers are rejected before any\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/references/runtime/cli-front-door-contract.md:\n  Line 67: | `skill_graph_scan` | **yes** | none |\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/references/graph/skill-graph-drift.md:\n  Line 112: node .skilled/bin/skill-advisor.cjs skill_graph_scan --trusted --json '{\"skillsRoot\":\".skilled/skills\"}' --format json\n\n  Line 119: If `advisor_rebuild` plus `skill_graph_scan` both fail:\n\n  Line 143: | New skill added but never indexed | `skill_graph_query` returns empty for the new skill | Run `skill_graph_scan` manually. If still missing, verify the new graph-metadata.json passes JSON validation |\n\n  Line 154: - [`tool-ids-reference.md`](../runtime/tool-ids-reference.md), `advisor_rebuild`, `skill_graph_scan`, `skill_graph_validate` schemas\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/skill-advisor-cli-trusted-prompt-time.vitest.ts:\n  Line 80:   it('blocks skill_graph_scan at prompt-time via OPENCODE_PROMPT_TIME=1 even with trusted env', () => {\n\n  Line 84:     const parsed = parseCliArgs(['skill_graph_scan']);\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/changelog/v0.1.0.0.md:\n  Line 21: - **Four MCP tools expose the skill graph.** `skill_graph_scan`, `skill_graph_query`, `skill_graph_status` and `skill_graph_validate` expose the package-local SQLite graph, letting maintainers inspect, query and validate it without advisor scoring. Its lifecycle, freshness and trust state mirror the advisor tools, giving graph rebuilds, audits and integration checks a stable MCP surface.\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/types.ts:\n  Line 63:   // NOT a runtime value: advisor_rebuild/skill_graph_scan re-index the existing\n\n\n/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/skill-graph-dispatch.vitest.ts:\n  Line 50:     await expect(dispatchTool('skill_graph_scan', { skillsRoot: '.skilled/skills' })).resolves.toMatchObject({\n\n\n(Results are truncated: showing first 50 results. Consider using a more specific path or pattern.)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"pattern\":\"skill_graph_scan\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor\",\"limit\":50}"},"time":{"start":1794521925323,"end":1794521926507}}}}
